OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Frather cloudy evening with the chance
OL,7,Fof a few more showers, especially in
OL,8,Fthe north and west. Overnight though
OL,9,Fit will become dry with clearer
OL,10,Fspells. A warm and humid night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FGenerally fine at first with
OL,13,Fsome very warm spells of sunshine
OL,14,Fdeveloping. However, as cloud
OL,15,Fincreases heading into the afternoon
OL,16,Fone or two showers are possible.
OL,17,FFeeling hot and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
